title: "[Beslisboom] StreamPipelineBehaviorPattern.Rewrite" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "Expliciete interface-\nimplementatie?" {shape: diamond}
q2: "Handle(request,\nStreamHandlerDelegate<T> next, ct)?" {shape: diamond}
q3: "Elk gebruik van next\nis next()?" {shape: diamond}
q4: "Request is typeparameter zonder\nIStreamRequest-constraint?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: explicit interface\n(geen proof)"
m2: "Manual: does not have the form\n(geen proof)"
m3: "Manual: next is used other than next()\n(next-passed)"
f1: "next(request, token) + where T : IStreamMessage\n(open)"
f2: "next(request, token), constraint ongemoeid\n(request-constraint)"
